0 // Description: Microscale 4 x 9 stud sloop hull (12 studs with the bowsprit): raked bow, gunport band, flat deck and raised quarterdeck with helm. The NPC sloop is this hull with one mast, square sails and four cannons.
0 // Parts: 39 (all inside the grouped submodel npc-sloop-hull.ldr, the hull of the NPC sloop in src/Sails/NpcShips.elm)
0 // Hull only: no mast or sail (add them in the editor)
0 // Bounds LDU: x -52..52, y -94..24, z -160..80 (size 104 x 118 x 240)
0 // Front / bow towards -Z, -Y up. The whole base is one submodel reference: move it as one piece.
1 16 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 npc-sloop-hull.ldr
0 NOFILE
